winemac: Add opt-in GDI surface update cadence and submission timing.

CYDER_SURFACE_PROFILE=1 enables fixed-size per-surface interval histograms and
five-second aggregate reports. Disabled surfaces allocate nothing and read no
clock. Intervals describe GDI surface submissions, not actual display scanout,
GPU completion, or the game's logical frame boundaries. No rendering policy change.

